    "created_at": "2025-10-08T20:12:46Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-10-08T20:12:46Z",
    "body": "Oh I see \"list of dimensions\" aren't integers. And the `frameset` `cols` and `rows` are reflected as `DOMString`s, so WebIDL doesn't help here.",
